🏠 House Prices Prediction - Kaggle Machine Learning Project

Overview

This project is a machine learning regression task to predict house sale prices using the Kaggle House Prices dataset.

Objective

The goal of this project is to build a regression model that can accurately predict residential house prices based on different property features.

Project Workflow

Data loading and exploration
Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
Missing value handling
Feature engineering
Categorical feature encoding
Model training and comparison
Hyperparameter tuning
Kaggle submission
Machine Learning Models

The following models were tested:

Linear Regression
Ridge Regression
Lasso Regression
ElasticNet
Random Forest Regressor
Gradient Boosting Regressor
XGBoost Regressor
